SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher001
"The Dark Lord's will is too strong..." 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher002
"No! Frodo!" 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher003
"Brave Sam!" 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher004
"Smeagol!" 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher005
"The restless dead surround us!" 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher006
"They are an endless tide! We must destroy their Barrow!" 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher007
"I sense a great evil here." 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher008
"Look out! The Onodrim are here!" 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher009
"We must flee, we cannot fight them." 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher010
"We must be more careful. These marshes hold a great many evil things." 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher011
"Sinda Spirit: You must go no further, periannath. The spirits of the dead lie in wait. They will harm you if you pass." 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher012
"Sinda Spirit: These spirits belong to warriors once under my command. Their death is on my conscience. \n They are trapped in this place, unable to move on. Consumed by rage and grief." 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher013
"Sinda Spirit: You must break the evil spell that binds us to this wretched land. \n Find our Barrows, and destroy them. Only then can you pass through in safety." 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher014
"Sinda Spirit: I will help you do this. Follow me, so that we may free my people from this curse of undeath." 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher015
"Steel your hearts! A Nazgul approaches!" 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher016
"Your cloaks will not conceal you from their gaze. Seek shelter nearby!" 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher017
"This wraith will not hurt me." 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher018
"The Nazgul patrol the marshes. Be wary, and prepare to hide when they approach!" 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher019
"Periannath! The Nazgul returns!" 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher020
"This Barrow has been cleansed. My kinsmen will cease to hinder your passage." 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher021
"Behold! Another Barrow lies ahead." 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher022
"Do not stop to rest just yet, periannath! " 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher023
"The mist unveils another Barrow. Let us do what must be done." 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher024
"We are approaching the far side of the marsh. Let us keep moving!" 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher025
"Sinda Spirit: We must place the sword upon the stone." 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher026
"Sinda Spirit: That Great Barrow is the anchor to the Dark Lord's spell. It tethers these wicked shades. We must burn it to release them." 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher027
"The Great Barrow has been cleared. My warriors are released!" 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher028
"The passage through the marshes is now open to you. Come! We must go quickly." 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher029
"Sinda Spirit: With your aid, I have found atonement for past deeds... I can feel the pull \n of the Utter West... my spirit cries for leaving. Thank you." 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher030
"Sinda Spirit: Though you have not told me, I have guessed your purpose. You bear a great evil with you, but I \n believe you possess the strength to resist it. Go now, and may Tauron keep you safe."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher031
"Sinda Spirit: Farewell..." 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gollum009
"Smeagol: Hurry, hobbits."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gollum010
"Smeagol: The Black Gate is very close."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher032
"Sinda Spirit: You must go no further, periannath. The dead lie in wait."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher033
"Sinda Spirit: They perished needlessly under my command. Now, consumed by rage and grief, \n they are shackled here by the dark power that slew them long ago."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher034
"Sinda Spirit: The evil spell that binds us to this wretched land must be broken. \n Find the barrows of the dead, and destroy them. Only then can you pass."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher035
"Sinda Spirit: It is time this torment is ended. Aid me in freeing my kin, and I will see you safely through the marshes."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher036
"Sinda Spirit: Follow me."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher037
"Sinda Spirit: I know this place... A barrow, to hold the fallen. Sons of Doriath, of Lindon... friends."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher038
"It stood dry then.. raised in haste upon the wide plains of Dagorlad, where our great Host made war."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher039
"But the world has changed... The waters creep slowly over the centuries, fed by sorrow."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher040
"Not I alone. But I laid stones here, weeping."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher041
"Sinda Spirit: We could not take them west. So we buried them beneath sky and wind....But evil seeps into forgotten things."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher042
"Sinda Spirit: What once held memory now holds malice."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher043
"The way forward is drowned. This barrow stands on an isle of firm ground. Follow its path, it leads through the mire."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher044
"Yes... But something stirs... a shadow dwells here now."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher046
"I cannot hold it. The living must bear it. Restore it, periannath, and this place may yet be stilled."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher047
"Sinda Spirit: My friend... what has become of you..."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher048
"He guards the path. We must defeat him before we can move on."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher049
"The wraith has faded. But for how long I cannot say. We must move quickly."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher050
"Sinda Spirit: Stay behind me!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher051
"The wraiths return! We must banish them!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_oropher052
"I will give you the rest you crave!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_sam203
"Sam: Mr. Frodo! Watch out!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_sam204
"Sam: Barrows? The dead!? What do we do?!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_sam205
"Sam: There's a mound, Mr Frodo... just there. Almost looks like a hill, but too even."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_sam206
"Through it?"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_sam207
"Watch out, Mr. Frodo!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_sam177
"Hide, mister Frodo!"
END

SCRIPT:MGShelo_Sam005
"Sam: What's that noise?"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_frodo163
"Frodo: The dead? Who are you?"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_frodo164
"Frodo: We seek safe passage. Can you aid us?"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_frodo165
"Frodo: We have no choice but to trust him."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_frodo166
"Frodo: A ruin? Here?"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_frodo167
"You built it?"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_frodo168
"Frodo: Quickly!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_frodo169
"Frodo: Thank you, friend. May you finally find peace."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_frodo170
"The wraith is gone."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_frodo171
"May he find his rest.."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_marshlord001
"Tethered Lord: You should not have come here."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_marshlord002
"Fools for kings... you will find no rest."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_marshlord003
